OL,3,AThousands of jobs at Virgin Media O2 to
OL,4,Abe cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of Virgin Media O2 staff face
OL,7,Fredundancy risk as the telecoms firm
OL,8,Flooks to save money in the face of
OL,9,Fbillions of pounds of debt and tougher
OL,10,Fcompetition.
OL,12,FThe broadband provider has not
OL,13,Ffinalised the number of roles to be cut
OL,14,Fbut it is likely be a sizeable chunk of
OL,15,Fits 16,000 workforce, the BBC
OL,16,Funderstands.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
