OL,3,AIsraeli strikes in Gaza kill eight
OL,4,Aincluding child, hospitals say
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the southern city of Khan Younis,
OL,7,Fthe Hamas-run ministry of interior said
OL,8,Fa drone attack targeted a group of
OL,9,Fpolice officers in the Al-Mawasi area,
OL,10,Fkilling five, as they were carrying out
OL,11,Ftheir routine duties.
OL,13,FThe Israeli military said it had
OL,14,Fcarried out two attacks on what it
OL,15,Fdescribed as military operatives but
OL,16,Fhas not yet provided evidence or
OL,17,Ffurther information.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
